<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador's monetary base up 0.42 pct in March.</title>
<headline>Ecuador's monetary base up 0.42 pct in March.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador's monetary base grew 0.42 percent to 2.85 billion sucres in March, the Central Bank said Tuesday.</p>
<p>In February, the monetary base fell 0.38 percent to 2.84 billion sucres. It totaled 3.06 billion sucres at the end of 1996.</p>
<p>((-- Gustavo Oviedo, Quito Newsroom, +5932 258433))</p>
